# Terraform working files. State lives in the remote S3 backend (versions.tf); it
# must NEVER be committed (it holds the generated ML_AUTH_TOKEN). The provider cache
# and plan files are machine-local. The .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (pinned
# provider hashes) — it is intentionally not ignored here.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Local var overrides may carry secrets/CIDRs; keep them out of git.
*.tfvars
!example.tfvars
